<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN SOLVAY BUYS 60 PCT OF SODI-DEVNYA.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN SOLVAY BUYS 60 PCT OF SODI-DEVNYA.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals company Solvay SA said on Thursday it had signed a preliminary agreement with the Bulgarian privatisation agency allowing it to acquire 60 percent of soda ash producer Sodi-Devnya for $160 million.</p>
</text>
